{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55222","headline":"题幽州盘山七言（在幽州北） · 李存勖","name":"题幽州盘山七言（在幽州北）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冲过浮云数千重，经霄始到最高峰。\n日出近观沧海水，斋时遥听梵天钟。\n千年松树巢仙鹤，五个盆池隐毒龙。\n下方乞食上方去，尘俗难寻道者踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李存勖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}